  {:page
   {:block/created-at 1765908146698,
    :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
    :build/properties {},
    :block/title "Getting Started with Claude Skills"},
   :blocks
   [{:block/title "## What are Claude Skills?",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "Claude Skills are reusable AI capabilities that extend Claude's functionality. They allow you to create specialized tools, workflows, and integrations that Claude can use to help with specific tasks.",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "## Key Concepts",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### Skills vs Extensions",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "- **Extensions**: Provide tools and context to Claude (like the Logseq extension you're using now)",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "- **Skills**: Pre-defined workflows or instructions that tell Claude how to use tools in specific ways",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### Components of a Skill",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "- **Instructions**: Clear directions on what the skill should do",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "- **Tools/Functions**: The actual capabilities Claude can invoke",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "- **Context**: Background information or examples to guide behavior",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "## Creating Your First Skill",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### Step 1: Define the Purpose",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "Start by clearly defining what problem your skill solves:\n- What task should it accomplish?\n- Who will use it?\n- What inputs does it need?\n- What outputs should it produce?",
     :block/created-at 1765908146698,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146698,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### Step 2: Write Clear Instructions",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "Good skill instructions should be:\n- **Specific**: Clearly state what to do\n- **Structured**: Break complex tasks into steps\n- **Actionable**: Use verbs and clear language\n- **Contextual**: Include relevant background information",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### Step 3: Identify Required Tools",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "Determine which tools or extensions your skill needs:\n- File system access?\n- API calls?\n- Database queries?\n- Code execution?\n- External integrations?",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### Step 4: Create the Skill Structure",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "A typical skill structure includes:\n\n```yaml\nname: my-skill-name\ndescription: Brief description of what this skill does\ninstructions: |\n  Detailed instructions for Claude on how to execute this skill.\n  Include:\n  1. Step-by-step process\n  2. Decision criteria\n  3. Expected outputs\n  4. Error handling\ntools:\n  - tool_name_1\n  - tool_name_2\nexamples:\n  - input: \"Example user request\"\n    output: \"Expected behavior\"\n```",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "## Best Practices",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### 1. Start Simple",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "Begin with a basic skill that does one thing well, then iterate and expand functionality.",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### 2. Provide Examples",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "Include concrete examples of:\n- Valid inputs\n- Expected outputs\n- Edge cases\n- Error scenarios",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### 3. Handle Errors Gracefully",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "Define how the skill should respond when:\n- Required information is missing\n- Tools fail or are unavailable\n- Unexpected inputs are provided\n- External services are down",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### 4. Test Thoroughly",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "Test your skill with:\n- Typical use cases\n- Edge cases\n- Invalid inputs\n- Different phrasings of requests",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### 5. Document Well",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "Include:\n- Clear description of purpose\n- Usage instructions\n- Prerequisites\n- Limitations\n- Version history",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "## Example: Simple Note-Taking Skill",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title
     "```yaml\nname: quick-note\ndescription: Quickly capture a note to Logseq inbox\ninstructions: |\n  When the user wants to capture a quick note:\n  1. Extract the main content from their message\n  2. Create a new block in the Logseq Inbox page\n  3. Add appropriate tags if mentioned\n  4. Confirm the note was saved\ntools:\n  - logseq__upsertNodes\n  - logseq__getPage\nexamples:\n  - input: \"Note: Buy groceries tomorrow\"\n    action: \"Create block with 'Buy groceries tomorrow' in Inbox\"\n  - input: \"Remind me to call mom #family\"\n    action: \"Create block with content and family tag\"\n```",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "## Common Skill Patterns",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
     :block/updated-at 1765908146699,
     :build/properties {}}
    {:block/title "### Data Collection Skills",
     :block/created-at 1765908146699,
